{"3532690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Climbing Gym Simulator", "steam_appid": 3532690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/extras/213f9d901f8967f907d05943e33c7128.avif?t=1786359523\" width=1232 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You own a climbing gym now. Are you qualified? Absolutely not. But that's not stopping you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climbing Gym Simulator</strong> is a first-person management game where you design, build, and run your own indoor climbing facility. Order holds, set routes, manage chaos, and transform a dusty little warehouse into a thriving climbing empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/extras/52b374ed02a3410cd907bfa98c773c2c.avif?t=1786359523\" width=1232 height=206 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use freeform tools to construct climbing walls and mats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place decorations, furniture, and utility objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape a welcoming layout that feels truly your own</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/extras/db944b92579470c6388660d901c5e87a.avif?t=1786359523\" width=1232 height=206 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order from a variety of climbing holds and volumes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely place holds on any climbing wall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign holds to routes with custom names, colors, and grades</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/extras/293ade4b87e20351512ba7e29aa6e2da.avif?t=1786359523\" width=1232 height=206 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your gym to NPC climbers and watch them struggle using fun ragdoll-based physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set entry, memberships, and item prices (like snacks, chalk, or rentals)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal with influencer visits, broken equipment, and unpredictable customer needs</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/extras/a9cbad3112a7badbc93a3303617e2394.avif?t=1786359523\" width=1232 height=206 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinvest profits to unlock new holds, objects and decorations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your space and access entirely new locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend skill points to streamline daily tasks and access new tools</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From a Climber</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It started with one climb. Now everything I own is covered in chalk, my knees are decorated with mystery bruises, and my bank account is in shambles. When I'm not making this game, I'm probably hanging off a wall pretending to use my legs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From a Solo Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No budget. No team. Just one guy making the climbing game he wishes existed. This is a love letter to climbing, gaming, and making dumb decisions in the name of passion. Please support the game... I really need a new pair of climbing shoes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/extras/42f52e2e3fd9545eee58d25449802919.avif?t=1786359523\" width=1232 height=206 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/extras/213f9d901f8967f907d05943e33c7128.avif?t=1786359523\" width=1232 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You own a climbing gym now. Are you qualified? Absolutely not. But that's not stopping you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climbing Gym Simulator</strong> is a first-person management game where you design, build, and run your own indoor climbing facility. Order holds, set routes, manage chaos, and transform a dusty little warehouse into a thriving climbing empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/extras/52b374ed02a3410cd907bfa98c773c2c.avif?t=1786359523\" width=1232 height=206 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use freeform tools to construct climbing walls and mats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place decorations, furniture, and utility objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape a welcoming layout that feels truly your own</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/extras/db944b92579470c6388660d901c5e87a.avif?t=1786359523\" width=1232 height=206 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order from a variety of climbing holds and volumes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely place holds on any climbing wall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign holds to routes with custom names, colors, and grades</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/extras/293ade4b87e20351512ba7e29aa6e2da.avif?t=1786359523\" width=1232 height=206 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your gym to NPC climbers and watch them struggle using fun ragdoll-based physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set entry, memberships, and item prices (like snacks, chalk, or rentals)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal with influencer visits, broken equipment, and unpredictable customer needs</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/extras/a9cbad3112a7badbc93a3303617e2394.avif?t=1786359523\" width=1232 height=206 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinvest profits to unlock new holds, objects and decorations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your space and access entirely new locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend skill points to streamline daily tasks and access new tools</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From a Climber</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It started with one climb. Now everything I own is covered in chalk, my knees are decorated with mystery bruises, and my bank account is in shambles. When I'm not making this game, I'm probably hanging off a wall pretending to use my legs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From a Solo Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No budget. No team. Just one guy making the climbing game he wishes existed. This is a love letter to climbing, gaming, and making dumb decisions in the name of passion. Please support the game... I really need a new pair of climbing shoes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/extras/42f52e2e3fd9545eee58d25449802919.avif?t=1786359523\" width=1232 height=206 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Run your own climbing gym in this first-person management game. Build walls, order holds, set routes, and expand your facility - all while keeping your climbers happy and preferably alive.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Czech, Danish, Finnish, Greek, Spanish - Latin America, Dutch, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Romanian, Swedish, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Hungarian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/159b0d30bf083dd4538785cfef1e8035e44b7493/header.jpg?t=1786359523", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/e54a7ddf30e018099bc7403bd1d71d72d0f15b81/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786359523", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532690/e54a7ddf30e018099bc7403bd1d71d72d0f15b81/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786359523", "website": "https://climbinggymsimulator.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 1050 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<s